  "recommendation": "Bluest Account",
  "reason": "For a three-month trip, it offers no Rho-Bank foreign ATM withdrawal fee and rebates third-party ATM operator fees up to $50 per monthly statement cycle. Its daily ATM withdrawal limit is $1,500.",
