  "important_note": "The Bluest Account’s foreign ATM fee is $0.00, but ATM operator fees can still apply after the $50 monthly rebate cap. If you want the lowest overall account cost rather than only ATM costs, I can compare the accounts’ complete fee schedules before you open one.",
